                        "form": "головомо́йках"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "21f15849-5665-33c9-9877-b689572d0e54",
                        "entry_id": "9c94cf41-1163-393f-9692-ccc12455785b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. строгий выговор с нравоучениями"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ae9691de-a2b0-4285-8e47-b90287b058a3",
                                "sense_id": "21f15849-5665-33c9-9877-b689572d0e54",
                                "text": "Директор заслужит свою головомойку на правлении акционеров, а товар начнёт поставляться из Китая."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cb5a953f-e7a6-4a7a-b1f1-70c872e8551c",
                                "sense_id": "21f15849-5665-33c9-9877-b689572d0e54",
                                "text": "Наконец, в разгар очередной вечеринки явился мент, разогнал честну́ю публику, устроил дикую головомойку художественным ковбоям и диванчик велел убрать."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c262c84d-f35f-40aa-9cd5-a147118597bb",
                                "sense_id": "21f15849-5665-33c9-9877-b689572d0e54",
                                "text": "Я её выгнал, а ребятам устроил головомойку."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cffa2eb6-4d39-4fbf-8e25-74ebbbf9c277",
                        "source_entry_id": "9c94cf41-1163-393f-9692-ccc12455785b",
                        "source_sense_id": "21f15849-5665-33c9-9877-b689572d0e54",
                        "target_lang_word": "dressing-down",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "dressing-down",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0389a7a0-b8b8-3bdd-a2a9-ed0a24d06423",
                                        "entry_id": "07dbbf6a-2b7b-3432-870e-e51bb7c8c7ef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A reprimand or rarely, a thrashing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef7fb5e5-9b90-4675-a752-322494c621a6",
                                                "sense_id": "0389a7a0-b8b8-3bdd-a2a9-ed0a24d06423",
                                                "text": "\"I'll give him a dressing down, see if I don't.\" Mrs. Mudge's eyes snapped viciously, and she clutched the relics of the broom with a degree of energy which rendered it uncertain what sort of a dressing down she intended for her husband."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1aa62190-6714-4ec4-b248-9e518949725d",
                                                "sense_id": "0389a7a0-b8b8-3bdd-a2a9-ed0a24d06423",
                                                "text": "When the blacksmith saw what Babo had done to his mother, he caught him by the collar, and fell to giving him such a dressing down as never man had before."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae7a3c6e-ad6a-4011-a005-8e524fad9f60",
                                                "sense_id": "0389a7a0-b8b8-3bdd-a2a9-ed0a24d06423",
                                                "text": "\"We must all bow to you, and try to get a favorable word, must we? This man shall have a leg up, and this man shall have a dressing down!\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12154691-b238-47c0-82d5-36d8edac6778",
                                                "sense_id": "0389a7a0-b8b8-3bdd-a2a9-ed0a24d06423",
                                                "text": "Just ask Gen. Yevgeny I. Ignatov, a former mayor of Torzhok, who stepped down two years ago after a dressing-down from the regional governor."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cc021f05-66cf-478f-b6b9-d953abd90638",
                        "source_entry_id": "9c94cf41-1163-393f-9692-ccc12455785b",
                        "source_sense_id": "21f15849-5665-33c9-9877-b689572d0e54",
                        "target_lang_word": "wigging",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "wigging",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a196791d-ea13-3a10-a3f6-47a7e636ba32",
                                        "entry_id": "2d02319f-d230-3ab9-98cb-c76bb44235f2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "present participle and gerund of wig"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of",
                                            "gerund",
                                            "participle",
                                            "present"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "wigging",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3cdbaf19-7726-3eec-a601-4f40490c64f0",
                                        "entry_id": "f3eefde0-e5fd-33df-8e73-904eb89f4d1c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The action of the verb wig (in various senses)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1e3fa689-5f16-33bf-8a39-91c5ca5d2bd0",
                                        "entry_id": "f3eefde0-e5fd-33df-8e73-904eb89f4d1c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A telling-off or reprimand."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "British",
                                            "Ireland",
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "countable",
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7682567a-4dea-428b-b3f9-5a990845bdc1",
                                                "sense_id": "1e3fa689-5f16-33bf-8a39-91c5ca5d2bd0",
                                                "text": "His Colonel talked to him severely when the cold weather ended. That made him more wretched than ever; and it was only an ordinary ‘Colonel's wigging’!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e505fc2f-ae7b-3976-a437-db957d2a15bd",
                                        "entry_id": "f3eefde0-e5fd-33df-8e73-904eb89f4d1c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The practice of male stuntmen performing for actresses."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f50e0703-eee2-4f72-bf85-bfdcfe29bdda",
                                                "sense_id": "e505fc2f-ae7b-3976-a437-db957d2a15bd",
                                                "text": "“So why are there so few women in the stunt industry? Many point to the practice of “wigging” – which is when male stunt actors play female characters.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
